<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">Yihuda Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yihuda Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yihu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yihuda</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yihudi Xaafida Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Yihuda kiitay xaafetiday, ammanonna de7ishe ammaniya asi daanidi wordo timirte laaliya asatape ammaniya asay naagetana mela akeekisanaasa. Ha qantha kiitay ba giddon oykida qofatan nam7antho Phexroosa kiita daanees. Ha kiita xaafey, “Ammaniya asas issitohonne wursethi gakanaw imetida ammanuwas oletite” yaagidi nabbabiya asaa minthidi qofisees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Sarotho <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JUD 1:1-2">1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wordo astamaaretanne enta kundethaa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JUD 1:3-16">3-16</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammano minthidi naagana mela imetida zore <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JUD 1:17-23">17-23</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galatanne woosa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JUD 1:24-25">24-25</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Taani Yihudi, Yesuus Kiristoosa aylley, Yayqooba ishay,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">Xoossay xeegidaysatas, Xoossa Aaway doseysatasinne Yesuus Kiristoosan naagetidaysatas ha dabdaabiya xaafayis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:55">Maato 13:55</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:3">Mar 6:3</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Maarotethi, sarotethinne siiqoy hintew kumo.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wordo Astamaareta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Ta siiqo ishato, nuuni issife shaaketiya atotethaaba hintew xaafanaw taani daro amottas. Shin ammaniya asaas issitohonne wursethi gakanaw imetida ammanuwas oletana mela hintena zorashe xaafanaysi taw koshshiyaba gidis. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Enta pirday benipe xaafetidi uttida, issi issi asati oonika eronna hinte giddo gelidosona. Enti Xoossaa eronnayisata, nu Xoossaa aadho keehatetha laymatanaw go7etiya oge oothidi ekoosona. Ba xalaala kawo gidida, nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa kaddoosona.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Shin hinte ha ubbaa eriyaba gidikoka, Goday Isra7eele asaa Gibxe biittafe waati kessidaako, qassi guyepe ammanonayisata dhaysidaysa ta hintena akeekisanaw koyayis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:51">Kessa 12:51</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:29-30">Taybo 14:29-30</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Banta de7iyasuwa aggidi, bantaw imetida maata naagiboonna kiitanchota, gita pirda gallasay gakanaw Xoossay enta dhumape garsan merinaa santhalaatan qachi wothis. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Hessada, Soodomenne Gamoora asaynne enta matan de7iya katamatan de7iya asay laymatidosona; laymatethara gahetiya tunatethi oothidosona. Enti merinaa taman pirdetanaysatas leemiso gididosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:1-24">Medhe 19:1-24</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Hessadaka, ha amuhanchoti banta asatethaa tunisoosona; maata aawata kadhoosona; salo medhetethata cayoosona. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Shin kiitanchota halaqay Mika7eeli Muse ahaas Xalahera palamida wode, “Goday nena seero” yaagisipe attishin, iya bolla cashsha qaala odidi mootanaw koybeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:13">Daane 10:13</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 10:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:1">12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:7">Qon 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 34:6">Zaare 34:6</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:2">Zaka 3:2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Shin ha asati bantaw eronnabaa ubbaa cayoosona; qassi enti wozani bayna meheda medhon eriya eray, I entana dhaysana. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Entana ayye! Enti Qaayela ogiyan bidosona. Miishe koyidi Balaama balan kundidosona. Qore geetetiya addey Xoossaa bolla dendidaysada enti Xoossaa bolla dendidi dhayidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-8">Medhe 4:3-8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 22:1-35">Taybo 22:1-35</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 16:1-35">16:1-35</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JUD 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Ha asati, hinte siiqo gibira miya bessan hintera uttiya wode yeelli bayna kawushata. Enti bantana xalaala heemmeyisata. Enti carkoy efiya iri bayna shaara mela. Qassi ayfe woden ayfe ayfonna, xaphora shodetidi, nam7u toho melida mitha mela. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Enti hanqetida abba zuliya mela banta pokuwa goponteyisata. Enti merinaw sakana dhumay naagiya toylatiya xoolintota.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Addaamepe doomidi, laapuntha yeleta gidida Heenokey, ha asataba tinbite odishe, “Heko, Goday, ba daro mukulu geeshshatara yaana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:18">Medhe 5:18</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">21-24</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />Asa ubbaa pirdana; geellata ubbaa enti oothida iita ooso ubbaa gishonne makallatethan enti Xoossaa bolla odetida iita odaa ubbaa gisho pirdana” yaagis. <verse eid="JUD 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />He asati ubba wode zuuzumeysatanne oda koyeyisata. Qassi banta iita amuwa kaalloosona; bantanan ceeqosonanne bantana go77iyabaa demmanaw harata sabboosona.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wursetha Zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Shin ta ishato, nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa hawaareti kase hintew odida qaala akeekite. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Enti, “Wursetha wodiyan, banta amuwa kaallidi toocheysati yaana” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:3">2 Phex 3:3</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />He asati asaa giddon shaahetethi medheyisata, banta asho amuwas haareteysatanne Geeshsha Ayyaanay baynayisata.<verse eid="JUD 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Shin ta ishato, geeshshi gidida hinte ammanuwan hintena dichanaw minnite; qassi Geeshsha Ayyaana wolqan woossite. <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />Hintena merinaa de7uwako gathiya nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa maarotethaa naagishe hintena Xoossaa siiquwan naagite.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Sidhey de7iya asaas qadhetite. <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />Issi issi asata tamape kessi ekite. Qassi iita amon tunida enta ma7uwa ixishe haratas yashshan qadhetite.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Galata Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Hinte kundonna mela naaganaw borey baynaysatanne gita ufaysan kumidaysata oothidi ba bonchuwa sinthan hintena shiishanaw danda7iya, <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />nuna ashshiya issi Xoossaas, nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa baggara bonchoy, gitatethi, wolqinne maati, kaseka, ha77ika, merinawuka iyaw gido. Amin7i.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>